{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE FULL VERSION WILL INCLUDE:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CLASSIC MODE:\u00a0</strong>Compete for high scores without the pressure of a time limit.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ARKEE TRIALS:\u00a0</strong>Perfect your skills by mastering many challenging levels.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SCORE ATTACK MODE:\u00a0</strong>Go against the clock while collecting bonuses for extra points!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ENDLESS MODE:\u00a0</strong>Relax and practice at your own pace, with no time constraints.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HIDDEN UNLOCKABLES:\u00a0</strong>Discover a ton of unlockable rewards!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong></strong><br><br><strong>TRY OUT THE DEMO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Arkee Malarkey</i> is a 3D merging puzzle game where you throw animals onto the Ark and merge them into new ones, all while trying to keep the Ark balanced! In this <strong>demo</strong>, try out a timed version of <strong>Classic Mode</strong>, or take on the <strong>Rookie Trials</strong> with 8 unique challenges from the <strong>Arkee Trials</strong> to test your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481930/extras/f7ddbaa5d3dfb1c901c85d333fe27863.poster.avif?t=1752571395\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481930/extras/f7ddbaa5d3dfb1c901c85d333fe27863.webm?t=1752571395\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481930/extras/f7ddbaa5d3dfb1c901c85d333fe27863.mp4?t=1752571395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=